assert draft is not menu, "`draft` and `menu` are still the same list. Make `draft` an independent copy."
assert draft == ["gazpacho", "salad", "steak", "tiramisu"], f"`draft` should be [''gazpacho'', ''salad'', ''steak'', ''tiramisu''], but is {draft!r}."
